  "content": "<div><font color=\"#ffffff\"><br></font></div><div><!--StartFragment--><font color=\"#ffffff\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-9013a685-7fff-5e7f-a7b6-bf491a9b2e0f\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Current Objectives:&nbsp;</span></p></span></font><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Find your Stolen Things.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Find out who framed you for stealing things from Hourglass Coven hag sisters.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Find the missing unicorn horn to unfreeze Zybilna in her palace.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">End the Hags’ tyranny over Prismeer.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Solve Bavlorna's Big Book of Bad Blood.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Solve the Puzzle Box.</span></li><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Swear oaths to fight against each of the 8 powerful figures</span></li></ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Rescue remaining kids from Loomlurch: Mishka, Sigh, Puddlemore, Squid, Elkhorn.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Stop the demons pouring into the Underdark from the Abyss.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Solve the Ollie copies plot. “Radnelac”, “Smite”, etc.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Bring Nib furnishings for his home.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Go to Neverlight Grove (home of the myconids like Shrump), Skab wants Daterra to collect spores or mushrooms from the heart of the grove and bring back to her for her alchemical experiments.&nbsp;Also Mr. Sixx says demonic influence is there. </span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Go to Blingdenstone (Sig's hometown and capital city of the deep gnomes), Skab wants a so-called \"king\" there investigated in case he is a threat to Skab and others. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14.6667px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Also Mr. Sixx says demonic influence is there. </span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Go to Gravenhollow Library to meet a drow named Vizeran for help and knowledge. (Graz'zt / Mr. Sixx gave this quest)</span></font></span></li></ul><font color=\"#ffffff\"><span><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.7999999999999998;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Mysteries &amp; Leads:&nbsp;</span></p></span></font><ul><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Rifts between Underdark, Feywild, and Abyss. “Faerzress” and “fairy circles” amplified.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Jibjib learned of conspiracies from his Patron. Also warned to return to Underdark asap.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Demons are pouring into the Underdark through portals for some reason.</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Zybilna and/or her Palace staff members have powerful magic items, make magic circles, and know about defeating/trapping demons.</span></li></ul><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>",
